{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026w17ix4RdpO1792688646.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>西藏那曲市巴青縣周四晚發生7級地震，當局啟動四級應急響應，據報有人受傷。</p><p></p><p>有監控鏡頭拍到地震一刻，辦公室搖晃，工作人員匆忙離開。有民眾爭相走到街上避險。《西藏日報》報道，較接近震央的崗切鄉震感強烈，至少兩名傷者送院治理，部分房屋牆身出現裂痕。距離巴青縣30公里的索縣，有明顯震感。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.QUAKE-0100_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026sfD8ezID3p1792688764.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>事發在昨晚10時33分，震源深度10公里。新華社指震央附近屬高原，平均海拔約4,800米，周邊人口稀少。</p><p></p><p><p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.QUAKE-0100_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Tuubah7fXE1792688679.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>巴青縣及甘肅消防救援隊伍等單位，趕去災區善後。國務院抗震救災指揮部啟動四級應急響應，指示相關部門全力做好搶險救援、安置居民及震情監測等工作。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.QUAKE-0100_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20261BMjRfHGuZ1792688705.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:40:38.391582+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":264,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T17:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T23:38:03.745961+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:38:09.636172+00:00","content_hash":"f57d04a46de00823bef0455661cb4d3d0825254253d21ca3c4bc31067483c053","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}